{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1588982400, "end_date": 1589587199, "month_true_total": 339, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:54:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "69191302", "author": {"steamid": "76561198431239400", "personaname": "collider_11", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198431239400/", "num_games_owned": 205, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 37206, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11216, "last_played": 1747319395, "avatar": "79a8119bd2a027755f93872d0d09b959909a0405"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有趣的背景设定，不错的游戏，但游戏中的物理碰撞和操作判定有很大的问题，包括但不限于对将挖掘地形的方向有加速度时人物大概率被推飞，侦察的爪钩射出判定以及反应速度，一个吧台widget不显示的BUG（[strike] 我经常遇到......但朋友似乎不会[/strike] ），并且此BUG触发后由于交互设置，队友也不可以买酒。以上问题实在是极其影响游戏体验，故在此提醒喜欢在游戏里飞来飞去的窜天猴同志，购买后请优先测试侦察的体验\n以上问题在更改语言为英语后未再出现", "timestamp_created": 1589568622, "timestamp_updated": 1589851861, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.532163739204406738", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "69182196", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066955778", "personaname": "RADIAL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Northsauces/", "num_games_owned": 576, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 21090, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6843, "last_played": 1745938316, "avatar": "243261b68b0a3b8b68992b0ee0c61b45cf44668b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏很好玩，我希望可以出更多武器和新模式", "timestamp_created": 1589557320, "timestamp_updated": 1589557320, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "co